{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-research-methods","title":"临床研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods","introMarkdown":"# 临床研究方法 简介\n\n临床研究方法是医学科学中连接基础发现与临床实践的核心桥梁，为评价诊断手段、治疗方案和预防策略的有效性提供系统的方法论支撑。掌握规范的临床研究设计与分析方法，是每一位从事医学研究的学习者必须具备的基本功。\n\n本课程从研究设计、统计分析、伦理规范和结局评价四个维度出发，系统构建临床研究的方法论框架。\n\n第一章**临床研究设计**讲解临床研究的主要类型和设计原则，包括随机对照试验的随机化与盲法策略、队列研究的前瞻性与回顾性设计，以及病例对照研究在病因探索中的应用逻辑。\n\n第二章**生物统计学**聚焦临床研究中常用的高级统计方法，涵盖生存分析中的Kaplan-Meier方法和Cox回归、Meta分析的效应量合并与异质性检验，以及临床试验样本量估算的原理和计算策略。\n\n第三章**临床研究伦理与法规**从受试者保护的角度审视研究行为的规范性，讨论伦理审查委员会的职责与审查要点、药物临床试验质量管理规范（GCP）的核心原则，以及知情同意的伦理基础与实践操作。\n\n第四章**临床结局研究**关注超越传统临床终点的综合评价方法，介绍患者报告结局的测量工具与应用场景、卫生经济学评价的基本方法，以及真实世界证据在药品监管和临床决策中的地位与挑战。\n\n建议学习者在具备基础流行病学和统计学知识后进入本课程，按章节顺序学习能够逐步建立从设计到评价的完整能力体系。研究设计与伦理规范应同步掌握，两者在实际研究中不可分割。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"study-design","title":"临床研究设计","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"randomized-controlled-trials","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 随机对照试验","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design/randomized-controlled-trials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cohort-studies","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 队列研究","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design/cohort-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"case-control-studies","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 病例对照研究","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design/case-control-studies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"biostatistics","title":"生物统计学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/biostatistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"survival-analysis","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 生存分析","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/biostatistics/survival-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"meta-analysis","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — Meta 分析","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/biostatistics/meta-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sample-size-calculation","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 样本量估算","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/biostatistics/sample-size-calculation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-regulation","title":"临床研究伦理与法规","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/ethics-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"irb-ethics-review","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 伦理审查委员会与伦理审查","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/ethics-regulation/irb-ethics-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"good-clinical-practice","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 药物临床试验质量管理规范","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/ethics-regulation/good-clinical-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"informed-consent-clinical","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 临床知情同意","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/ethics-regulation/informed-consent-clinical"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"outcomes-research","title":"临床结局研究","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/outcomes-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"patient-reported-outcomes","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 患者报告结局","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/outcomes-research/patient-reported-outcomes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-economics-evaluation","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 卫生经济学评价","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/outcomes-research/health-economics-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-world-evidence","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 真实世界证据","url":"/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/outcomes-research/real-world-evidence"}]}]}